WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.868
-Finally, you guys, tomorrow
is the last day of January,

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.100
so I thought it would be nice to
give a little recap

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.367
of the entire month.

00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:07.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.868 --> 00:00:10.767
[ Ukulele plays ]

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:12.868
♪ It's the end of January ♪

00:00:12.868 --> 00:00:15.000
♪ What a big month
for Prince Harry ♪

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.934
♪ He wrote a wrote a book,
and did you see this ♪

00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:21.067
♪ He got frostbite... ♪
-On his penis.

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:23.133
-♪ Congress voted
for a speaker ♪

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:25.067
♪ It turned out
to be a squeaker ♪

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:27.133
♪ McCarthy said,
"I got this, bro." ♪

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:29.868
♪ Then he lost... ♪
-14 times in a row.

00:00:29.868 --> 00:00:31.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:34.133
-♪ Poor George Santos
under fire ♪

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.100
♪ Everyone says
that he's a liar ♪

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.934
♪ His résumé
is not so clean ♪

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:40.901
♪ Plus, he used to be... ♪
-A drag queen?!

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:44.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.334 --> 00:00:47.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:54.467
-Yeah. [ Chuckles ]

00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:56.300
♪ Biden, Trump,
and Pence got caught ♪

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.534
♪ with houses
full of secret docs ♪

00:00:58.534 --> 00:01:00.534
♪ How the heck
could you forget? ♪

00:01:00.534 --> 00:01:02.667
♪ Joe kept them next to... ♪
-My Corvette.

00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:04.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.968 --> 00:01:07.234
-♪ The robot movie "M3GAN"
crushed ♪

00:01:07.234 --> 00:01:09.434
♪ And people loved
"The Last of Us" ♪

00:01:09.434 --> 00:01:11.334
♪ "Avatar," it didn't bomb ♪

00:01:11.334 --> 00:01:13.734
♪ It made us all say... ♪
-Oh, my God.

00:01:13.734 --> 00:01:15.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:18.000
-♪ Eagles/Chiefs,
Super Bowl ♪

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.067
♪ Niners/Bengals watched
from home ♪

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:22.133
♪ Can't talk trash from
your couch, gotta... ♪

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:24.567
-Know your role
and shut your mouth.

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:27.567
[ Laughter,
cheers and applause ]

00:01:31.701 --> 00:01:33.801
-♪ It was the first month
of the year ♪

00:01:33.801 --> 00:01:35.834
♪ We all got through it
without beer ♪

00:01:35.834 --> 00:01:37.767
♪ But February isn't dry ♪

00:01:37.767 --> 00:01:41.000
♪ So let's get trashed
on Valentine's ♪

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:43.567 --> 00:01:44.634
♪♪

